  "helpWelcomeTitle": "Welcome to BookMyPT!",
  "helpMemberIntroBody": "With this app, you can easily book appointments with your trainer, track your progress, and manage your session packages.",
  "helpPtIntroBody": "With this app, you can easily manage your members' appointments, create session packages, and track your earnings.",
  "helpHomeTitle": "Home Screen",
  "helpHomeItem1Title": "Trainer Information",
  "helpHomeItem1Body": "Your assigned PT, remaining session credits, and upcoming appointments are visible at a glance on the home screen.",
  "helpHomeItem2Title": "If No PT Assigned",
  "helpHomeItem2Body": "You can add your trainer to the system using their email via the \"Find PT\" feature. Once the PT adds you, appointments and packages become active.",
  "helpHomeItem3Title": "Leave Membership",
  "helpHomeItem3Body": "You can disconnect from your trainer using the \"Leave Membership\" button on the PT card. Your remaining session credits are not affected.",
  "helpCalendarTitle": "My Appointments",
  "helpCalendarItem1Title": "Creating an Appointment Request",
  "helpCalendarItem1Body": "Press the + button at the top right, select date and time. If your package has a session duration, it is set automatically. Your request is sent for PT approval.",
  "helpCalendarItem2Title": "Calendar Tab",
  "helpCalendarItem2Body": "You can see all your appointments by day. Blue dots indicate your appointments, grey dots indicate times when the PT is busy. Tap pending requests to change the date or time.",
  "helpCalendarItem3Title": "History Tab",
  "helpCalendarItem3Body": "You can see the count and total duration of completed sessions. Upcoming confirmed appointments are also listed in this tab.",
  "helpCalendarItem4Title": "Appointment Statuses",
  "helpCalendarItem4Body": "• Pending: Request created, awaiting PT approval.\n• Confirmed: PT accepted, session will happen.\n• Completed: Session took place.\n• Cancelled: Session was cancelled.",
  "helpMyCalendarTitle": "My Calendar",
  "helpMyCalendarItem1Title": "Adding Personal Events",
  "helpMyCalendarItem1Body": "You can add personal events (workout, meeting, holiday, etc.) with the + button at the top right. These events only appear in your calendar.",
  "helpMyCalendarItem2Title": "PT Availability",
  "helpMyCalendarItem2Body": "Your PT's appointments with other members and personal events appear in grey. This lets you check availability before making an appointment request.",
  "helpMyCalendarItem3Title": "Editing Events",
  "helpMyCalendarItem3Body": "Tap your personal events to edit the date, time, duration, and notes, or delete them.",
  "helpPackagesTitle": "My Packages",
  "helpPackagesItem1Title": "Buying a Package",
  "helpPackagesItem1Body": "You can see session packages offered by your PT on this screen. Pressing \"Purchase\" creates a payment request; your session credits are added after PT approval.",
  "helpPackagesItem2Title": "Member-Specific Packages",
  "helpPackagesItem2Body": "Your PT may have created a specially priced or custom package for you. Only you can see these packages.",
  "helpPackagesItem3Title": "Payment History",
  "helpPackagesItem3Body": "All your payment requests and their statuses (Pending / Completed) are listed at the top of the screen.",
  "helpProgressTitle": "Progress",
  "helpProgressItem1Title": "Entering Measurements",
  "helpProgressItem1Body": "You can record your weight, height, and body measurements. You can also track visual progress by adding photos.",
  "helpProgressItem2Title": "Backdated Entry",
  "helpProgressItem2Body": "You can make backdated entries by selecting a date for days you forgot to log.",
  "helpProgressItem3Title": "Chart Tracking",
  "helpProgressItem3Body": "Your recorded measurements are shown as charts. You can easily track your changes over time.",
  "helpMessagesTitle": "Messages",
  "helpMemberMessagesItem1Title": "Communication with PT",
  "helpMemberMessagesItem1Body": "You can message your PT directly. Use this screen for session changes, questions, or workout notes.",
  "helpPtHomeItem1Title": "Daily Summary",
  "helpPtHomeItem1Body": "Today's appointments, pending requests, and recent member activity are listed on the home screen.",
  "helpPtHomeItem2Title": "Pending Requests",
  "helpPtHomeItem2Body": "You can quickly approve or reject your members' appointment requests here. A notification is sent to the member when you approve.",
  "helpPtHomeItem3Title": "Activation Requests",
  "helpPtHomeItem3Body": "Passive members can send activation requests. You can manage these requests from the home screen.",
  "helpPtCalendarTitle": "Calendar",
  "helpPtCalendarItem1Title": "Appointment Management",
  "helpPtCalendarItem1Body": "All your members' sessions appear on the calendar as colored dots. Click a day to see the detailed list for that day.",
  "helpPtCalendarItem2Title": "Personal Events",
  "helpPtCalendarItem2Body": "You can add personal events like holidays or meetings using the + button at the top right. These times appear as \"busy\" on members' appointment calendars.",
  "helpPtCalendarItem3Title": "Session Detail",
  "helpPtCalendarItem3Body": "Click a session in the list to open the detail screen, update its status (confirm / cancel / complete), and add notes.",
  "helpPtMembersTitle": "Members",
  "helpPtMembersItem1Title": "Adding a Member",
  "helpPtMembersItem1Body": "Press the + button to add a new member and enter their information. The added member is linked to you and can book appointments.",
  "helpPtMembersItem2Title": "Member Management",
  "helpPtMembersItem2Body": "Click a member card to view their profile details, add personal goals and notes, and track remaining session credits.",
  "helpPtMembersItem3Title": "Active / Passive Status",
  "helpPtMembersItem3Body": "When you set a member to passive, they cannot create new appointment requests. If they send an activation request, you approve it.",
  "helpPtPackagesTitle": "Package Management",
  "helpPtPackagesItem1Title": "Creating a Package",
  "helpPtPackagesItem1Body": "You can create a package by specifying the number of sessions, duration, and price. Packages are visible to all active members.",
  "helpPtPackagesItem2Title": "Member-Specific Package",
  "helpPtPackagesItem2Body": "With the \"Member-specific\" option, you can define a specially priced package for a specific member. This package only appears on that member's Packages screen.",
  "helpPtPackagesItem3Title": "Session Duration",
  "helpPtPackagesItem3Body": "If you specify a session duration in a package, the duration is set automatically when that member books an appointment and the member cannot select manually.",
